@Priority Envelope check for W-2 (30 money, 2 calls, 20 min, 1 retry). W-1 is done, so W-2 is ready. W-3 needs W-2 done. W-4 is ready but waits for the single-writer lock on index.html. Rule: Dependency order first. Ties go to the workflow that unblocks the most downstream work (W-2 unblocks W-3, W-4 unblocks none), then registration order. One run at a time on index.html..
HOLD W-3: W-2 (wf-info) must be done
HOLD W-4: index.html write lock is held by the W-2 run; starts after W-3 finishes
